# Make the console draw Cullet Mono at 11 pt, and save it.
# Run it with: vtium config tui --macro cullet-11.vtmacro --live
Set Live
Alt+L
Expect At looks
Click "console"
Enter
Click "Font set"
Enter
Click "cullet-mono"
Enter
Click "Size"
Enter
Click "11 pt"
Enter
Expect "cullet-mono"
Expect "11 pt"
Ctrl+S
Enter
Expect Saved
